# API Integration Guide

## Goal Strategy Service

### Example: Creating a SMART Goal

```typescript
// See implementation: /services/goal-strategy/src/routes/goals.ts:99-175
import { translateGoal } from '@personalea/goal-strategy';

const result = await translateGoal({
  raw_goal: 'I want to learn Spanish',
  context: { timeframe: '6 months' }
});
```

